#: ../../config/options_scripting.rst:4
msgid ":index:`Scripting Options <configuration; scripting, scripts; tagging>`"
msgstr ":index:`脚本选项 <configuration; scripting, scripts; tagging>`"

#: ../../config/options_scripting.rst:6
msgid "This section allows for the management of user-defined tagging scripts."
msgstr "本节允许管理用户定义的标签脚本。"

#: ../../config/options_scripting.rst:21
msgid "The \"Enable Tagger Script(s)\" checkbox at the top of the page allows you to completely disable all tagging scripts. This can be useful when tracking down a problem with Picard's configuration."
msgstr ""
"页面顶部的“启用标签器脚本(s)”复选框允许你完全禁用所有标签脚本。这在跟踪 "
"Picard 配置问题时很有用。"

#: ../../config/options_scripting.rst:23
msgid "Below the checkbox are two columns showing the list of scripts in the left-hand column, with the content of the selected script shown in the right-hand column. This section allows you to add, remove and reorder the scripts, enable or disable individual scripts, as well as edit the currently selected script."
msgstr ""
"复选框下方有两列，左侧列出了脚本，右侧显示了选定脚本的内容。本节允许你添加、"
"删除和重新排序脚本，启用或禁用单个脚本，以及编辑当前选定的脚本。"

#: ../../config/options_scripting.rst:25
msgid "As of Picard v2.7 you can also import a new script from a file, or export an existing script to a file. Files can be stored as either a plain-text script or a Picard Tagging Script Package stored in YAML format."
msgstr ""
"自 Picard v2.7 起，你也可以从文件导入新脚本，或将现有脚本导出到文件。文件可以"
"存储为纯文本脚本或 YAML 格式的 Picard 标签脚本包。"

#: ../../config/options_scripting.rst:27
msgid "The script editor automatically highlights the elements of the script, including :doc:`function names <../functions/list_by_type>` and :doc:`tag and variable names <../variables/variables>`. Hovering your mouse pointer over one of the highlighted entries will display help information about the entry if available."
msgstr ""
"脚本编辑器会自动突出显示脚本中的元素，包括 :doc:`function names <../"
"functions/list_by_type>` 和 :doc:`tag and variable names <../variables/"
"variables>`。将鼠标指针悬停在其中一个突出显示的条目上时，如果可用，将显示该条"
"目的帮助信息。"

#: ../../config/options_scripting.rst:29
msgid "Unicode characters can be entered into the script using the format ``\\uXXXX`` where \"XXXX\" is the hexadecimal value of the unicode character."
msgstr ""
"可以使用格式 ``\\uXXXX`` 将 Unicode 字符输入脚本中，其中 \"XXXX\" 是 Unicode "
"字符的十六进制值。"

#: ../../config/options_scripting.rst:31
msgid "When the checkbox beside the script is checked, that script will be executed automatically, once for each track in the release, when Picard retrieves information for a release from the MusicBrainz website. If the checkbox is left unchecked, then the script will not be executed automatically."
msgstr ""
"当脚本旁边的复选框被选中时，该脚本将在 Picard 从 MusicBrainz 网站检索发行品信"
"息时，为发行品中的每个音轨自动执行一次。如果复选框未被选中，则脚本不会自动执"
"行。"

#: ../../config/options_scripting.rst:33
msgid "Regardless of whether or not the script is executed automatically, it can also be executed manually by right-clicking on an item in the clustering pane (middle pane) or the tagging pane (right-hand pane) and selecting it from the list displayed when :menuselection:`\"Run Scripts\"` is selected. If a cluster is selected in the middle pane or a release is selected in the right-hand pane, the script will be executed for each track in the selected cluster or release. If only a single track or file is selected, then the script will only be executed for that track or file."
msgstr ""
"无论脚本是否自动执行，都可以通过右键单击聚类窗格（中间窗格）或标签窗格（右侧"
"窗格）中的项目，并从选中 :menuselection:`\"Run Scripts\"` 时显示的列表中选择"
"来手动执行。如果在中间窗格中选择了一个聚类，或者在右侧窗格中选择了一个发行品"
"，则脚本将对选定聚类或发行品中的每个音轨执行。如果只选择了一个音轨或文件，则"
"脚本只对该音轨或文件执行。"

#: ../../config/options_scripting.rst:35
msgid "For additional information about scripting please see the \":doc:`Scripts <../extending/scripts>`\" and \":doc:`Scripting <../extending/scripting>`\" sections, as well as \":doc:`Tags & Variables <../variables/variables>`\"."
msgstr ""
"有关脚本的其他信息，请参阅 \":doc:`Scripts <../extending/scripts>`\" 和 "
"\":doc:`Scripting <../extending/scripting>`\" 部分，以及 \":doc:`Tags & "
"Variables <../variables/variables>`\"。"
